  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 10.9,
      "end": 15.94,
      "text": "The online video culture is growing. A national survey by the Pew Research Center",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125987,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031586
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 15.94,
      "end": 21.78,
      "text": "shows that nearly 8 in 10 American adult internet users watch or download online videos.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125987,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031586
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 21.78,
      "end": 27.3,
      "text": "And in the last four years, the percent of adult internet users who post video online has doubled.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125987,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031586
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 28.34,
      "end": 34.26,
      "text": "What are they watching? Comedy, educational, and how-to videos top the list for the most viewed",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125987,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031586
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 34.26,
      "end": 38.42,
      "text": "online video content, with music videos following closely behind.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.125987,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.031586
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 38.42,
      "end": 44.66,
      "text": "Those most likely to watch online video tend to be young, college-educated, and wealthy,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.102507,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001501
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 44.66,
      "end": 47.78,
      "text": "but the behavior is growing across all online adults.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.102507,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001501
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 49.06,
      "end": 54.42,
      "text": "And they're not just watching. One in four online adults have uploaded a video to the internet,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.102507,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001501
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 54.42,
      "end": 58.02,
      "text": "and one in five have posted content that they've created themselves.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.102507,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001501
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 58.82,
      "end": 63.7,
      "text": "What's behind this growth? Now that 91% of Americans own cell phones,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.102507,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001501
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 63.7,
      "end": 68.58,
      "text": "most can record, post, or watch videos virtually anywhere, anytime.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001151
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 68.58,
      "end": 75.86,
      "text": "41% of cell phone owners use their phones to record video, 40% use their phones to watch video,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001151
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 75.86,
      "end": 81.7,
      "text": "and 20% use their phones to post videos online. The growing popularity of social network sites",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001151
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 81.7,
      "end": 88.5,
      "text": "is also fueling the growth of online video. Today, 72% of online adults use social networking sites,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001151
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 88.5,
      "end": 91.46,
      "text": "which are popular venues for sharing video content.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.049936,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.001151
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 91.46,
      "end": 94.98,
      "text": "The most popular subjects for those who post their own videos online",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.110212,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000444
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 94.98,
      "end": 99.7,
